  "content": "<p>Texture a set of low-poly assets with a single shared color-palette texture, a common technique for stylized games.</p>\n<h2>Learning Objectives</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Unwrap UVs onto a shared palette texture</li>\n<li>Use one material across many assets</li>\n<li>Keep a consistent stylized color scheme</li>\n</ol>\n"
